FABIAN REVIEW QUARTERLY MAGAZINE - AUTUMN 2026
@thefabians This edition of the Fabian Review centres on the global climate emergency, with contributions from climate experts and an interview with energy secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh MP, alongside pieces on Labour’s vision of freedom, the UK’s proscription regime, LGBTQ+ rights, education, AI in public services, higher education, and Britain’s relationship with Europe.
